? Cash in a reward immediately, or hold on to it for an even bigger payoff? The choice is yours, as well as the punishment and the profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/3b434b56616caa83c858ba971e66afe6.avif?t=1787164402\" width=1536 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/058cbfffeb7918f408f6d8b82d9f920d.poster.avif?t=1787164402\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/058cbfffeb7918f408f6d8b82d9f920d.webm?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/058cbfffeb7918f408f6d8b82d9f920d.mp4?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Repo is your arsenal, and its program cards, your weapons. Get new Programs as you explore, upgrade your favorites and remove your less effective ones to optimize you combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/884782d17045ec9c4cff88efc2b134f0.avif?t=1787164402\" width=1536 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/c24ab9630da7c2dc10fd51d1efc0f2fe.poster.avif?t=1787164402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/c24ab9630da7c2dc10fd51d1efc0f2fe.webm?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/c24ab9630da7c2dc10fd51d1efc0f2fe.mp4?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a hacker, your Console is an extension of your mind and body. Customize it to match your playstyle by unlocking hardware mods and perks. The more you hone your skills, the more options you’ll discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/37f2b71708daede70cf16d3a5f45fceb.avif?t=1787164402\" width=1536 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/6913823b8e00e76b304093c063481551.poster.avif?t=1787164402\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/6913823b8e00e76b304093c063481551.webm?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576200/extras/6913823b8e00e76b304093c063481551.mp4?t=1787164402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Into The Grid includes different characters, each with its own gameplay mechanics, art, and story arcs (single player campaigns available at full launch).</p>", "short_description": "Become a master hacker in this Cyberpunk Roguelike Deckbuilder. Explore the dangers of cyberspace and fight evil corporations. Build and upgrade a deck of powerful programs. Unlock perks and skil